       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. EXECHV.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-EMPNO PIC X(6).
       01 WS-SALARY PIC S9(7)V99.
       01 WS-SAL-IND PIC S9(4) COMP.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           EXEC SQL
               SELECT SALARY INTO :WS-SALARY:WS-SAL-IND
                 FROM EMPLOYEE
                WHERE EMPNO = :WS-EMPNO
           END-EXEC.
           STOP RUN.
